Third-party licenses of hanafubuki, the hanafubuki-launcher binary
==================================================================

The hanafubuki-launcher binary is built from the Rust crates below, each under
the license listed with it. Their source code, including that of the crates
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, is published on crates.io
(https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>). The launcher's own crate is
hanafubuki, under GPL-3.0-only (see LICENSE).

The window is drawn with iced (https://github.com/iced-rs/iced, MIT), which
brings the text-shaping, windowing and image stacks listed here.

